From: Nicolas Schodet <nico@ni.fr.eu.org>
Date: Sat, 5 Apr 2025 22:38:03 +0200
Subject: Propagate build flags to every modules

This is necessary to make sure hardening flags are propagated.

Forwarded: not-needed
---
 Makefile.in           | 143 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 Makefile.tpl          |  17 +++++-
 configure.in          |   8 +++
 libiberty/Makefile.in |   4 +-
 4 files changed, 167 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Makefile.in b/Makefile.in
index 5d9c327..8e30889 100644
